# Python

When editing matching files:

- Apply engineering foundations first (always-applied rule).
- Prefer the project's Python skill; if none, load this plugin's `skills/ankyr-python/SKILL.md` if installed.
- Load its `references/` only when the skill directs.
- Follow the nearest `AGENT.md` chain for Validate commands.

Key rules: builtin generics, no `Any` / bare `object`, Google docstrings, relative imports, `pathlib`, fail-fast semantic exceptions, keyword-only extras, uv/ruff/mypy.
